    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE54.35 second bullet (holding periods CRE22.61 to CRE22.64)",
      "summary": "CRE54.35 cites CRE22.61 to CRE22.64 for SFT holding periods, but those paragraphs contain none; the holding periods are in CRE22.56 to CRE22.58.",
      "impact": "Position: Netting set of repo-style SFTs with a member, daily remargining Reading a: Literal range gives no holding period Reading b: CRE22.57: five business days (20 if more than 5000 trades in a quarter, CRE22.58) Difference: Haircut scaling sqrt(10/5)",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
